ble-wrap position="float" id="T2"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Comparison of the power<sup>A </sup>of 100 samples<sup>B </sup>for three models</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td align="center">Gene</td><td align="center">Variable</td><td align="center">Model 1<sup>C</sup></td><td align="center">Model 2<sup>C</sup></td><td align="center">Model 3<sup>C</sup></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="center">b34</td><td align="center">I<sub>1 </sub><sup>D</sup></td><td align="center">0.73</td><td align="center">0.79</td><td align="center">0.80</td></tr><tr><td align="center">b35</td><td align="center">I<sub>2</sub></td><td align="center">0.55</td><td align="center">0.65</td><td align="center">0.65</td></tr><tr><td align="center">b36</td><td align="center">I<sub>3</sub></td><td align="center">0.59</td><td align="center">0.55</td><td align="center">0.56</td></tr><tr><td align="center">s10</td><td align="center">I<sub>4</sub></td><td align="center">0.98</td><td align="center">1.00</td><td align="center">1.00</td></tr><tr><td align="center">s11</td><td align="center">I<sub>5</sub></td><td align="center">0.92</td><td align="center">0.90</td><td align="center">0.90</td></tr><tr><td align="center">s12</td><td align="center">I<sub>6</sub></td><td align="center">0.62</td><td align="center">0.60</td><td align="center">0.60</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p><sup>A </sup>LOD score &#x02265; 1.0 (i.e., <italic>T </italic>&#x02265; 2.14) is the critical value for the test. <sup>B </sup>Each sample was derived from around <italic>n </italic>= 99,300 observations from about <italic>n </italic>= 2747 sib pairs. <sup>C </sup>Model 1: independence model; Model 2: random effects model with two random effects; Model 3: random effects model with three random effects. <sup>D</sup><italic>I</italic><sub><italic>k </italic></sub>(<italic>k </italic>= 1, ..., 6) is the number of alleles IBD at marker locus closest to a gene that determines <italic>SBP</italic>.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></sec></back></article>